Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.35,0:00:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个遥远的星系里…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:38.45,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星球大战》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:52.59,Title,0,0,0,0,,《前传：克隆人的进攻》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河参议院
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,正处乱世之秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.85,0:01:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,数以千计的恒星系已声明意图脱离共和
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一分裂运动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在神秘的杜库伯爵领导下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.65,0:01:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,令已经为数不多的绝地武士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在维护银河系和平与秩序时困难重重
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,前任纳布皇后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米达拉参议员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,正返回银河参议院
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就建立共和军队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,以协助处于弱势的绝地武士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一重要议题进行投票…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员，我们正准备在克拉斯肯（共和国首都）着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator, we're making our final approach into Coruscant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,平安到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no danger at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,克黛尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cordé.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人，真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milady, I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.37,0:03:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有辱你的使命，参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've failed you, Senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人，这里还是很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milady, you're still in danger here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.85,0:04:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真不该回来 - 但这次投票至关重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I shouldn't have come back. - This vote is very important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽了你的职责，克黛尔也是，我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did your duty. Cordé did hers. Now, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米达拉参议员，请走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Amidala, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们，我不知道还能拖延多久再投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how much longer I can hold off the vote, my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越多的星系正在投靠分裂派\N{\fnArial\fs30}More and more star systems are joining the separatists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们真的和我们一分为二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they do break away…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不允许维系了千年之久的共和国…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not let this Republic that has stood for a thousand years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,分崩离析\N{\fnArial\fs30}be split in two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈判不会失败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My negotiations will not fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们真的和我们决裂了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they do, you must realize…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得知道现有的绝地武士远不足以保护共和国\N{\fnArial\fs30}there aren't enough Jedi to protect the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是和平守护者，而不是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're keepers of the peace, not soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Yoda…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为战争真会爆发吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you think it will really come to war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔，黑暗势力笼罩了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dark side clouds everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能预见未来会如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible to see the future is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[胡图族语]反分裂委员会已经抵达，阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Loyalist Committee has arrived, Your Honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - [胡图族语] 等候您的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - [Hutu language]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他们进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.06,0:05:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我们以后再议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will discuss this matter later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米达拉参议员，在着陆区发生的不幸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Amidala, your tragedy on the landing platform…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你安然无恙，让我甚感欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing you alive brings warm feelings to my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道谁是幕后主使吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea who was behind this attack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有情报表明是纳布卫星上心怀不满的香料采集工干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our intelligence points to disgruntled spice miners on the moons of Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为杜克伯爵是幕后主使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that Count Dooku was behind it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个政治理想主义者，而不是杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a political idealist, not a murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道，夫人，杜克伯爵曾经是个绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, milady, Count Dooku was once a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会用暗杀这招的，这不符合他的性格\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't assassinate anyone. It's not in his character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一点是肯定的，参议员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for certain, Senator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的处境极为危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}in grave danger you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地大师，我能提议…\N{\fnArial\fs30}MasterJedi, may I suggest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,将参议员置于你仁慈的保护之下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the senator be placed under the protection of your graces?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.05,0:06:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这样的紧张局势下，你以为这真的是明智之举吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think that's a wise decision under these stressful times?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相，请容我冒昧进言，我认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chancellor, if I may comment, I do not believe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,形势并没那么严重…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation is that serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.35,0:06:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不这么认为，参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I do, Senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全明白，加强戒备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize all too well that additional security…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会给你带来不便\N{\fnArial\fs30}might be disruptive for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果是你的熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but perhaps someone you're familiar with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个老朋友，比如欧比旺·肯诺比大师…\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old friend, like Master Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这完全有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚解决完安尼森的边界争端回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just returned from a border dispute on Ansion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.71,0:06:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我，夫人，行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it for me, milady. Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到有可能会失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thought of losing you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人难以接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}is unbearable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让欧比旺立刻向你报到，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have Obi-Wan report to you immediately, milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，温杜大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Master Windu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好像有点紧张 - 没有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You seem a little on edge. - Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没见你这么紧张过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't felt you this tense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从上次我们身陷暗之巢穴以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}since we fell into that nest of gundarks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你掉进那个可怕的地方，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fell into that nightmare, Master…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我救了你，记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I rescued you, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…对喔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都出汗了，放轻松，深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sweating. Relax. Take a deep breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有十年没见她了，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen her in ten years, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比？欧比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi? Obi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师，见到你真开心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa so smilen to seein yousa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴再见到你，加加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you again, JarJar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:07:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员，帕德梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Padmé.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师请过来！瞧，瞧，参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa palos here! Lookie, lookie, Senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desa Jedi arriven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸再见到你，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a great pleasure to see you again, milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好久不见了，肯诺比大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been far too long, Master Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.07,0:08:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪，你长大了 - 你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My goodness, you've grown. - So have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.01,0:08:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，变得更漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grown more beautiful, I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我…我是说，以一个参议员的标准来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for a senator, I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安，你还是你那个我在塔图因星认识的小男孩一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani, you'll always be that little boy I knew on Tatooine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人，我们保证不会干扰你的行动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our presence here will be invisible, milady, I can assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是泰弗上尉，负责女皇陛下的保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Captain Typho of Her Majesty's security service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米拉女皇已经得知你们的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen Jamillia has been informed of your assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很感谢你能来，肯诺比大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am grateful you are here, Master Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前形势比参议员所想的要危险得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation is more dangerous than the senator will admit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.70,0:08:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要的不是安全防卫，而是答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need more security. I need answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道是谁想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know who's trying to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来保护你的，参议员，不是来做调查的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here to protect you, Senator, not to start an investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:08:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会查到是谁干的，帕德梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find out who's trying to kill you, Padmé.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会去做职责之外的事，我年轻的徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not exceed our mandate, my young Padawan learner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.05,0:09:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这是为了更好地保护她，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant that in the interest of protecting her, Master, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再多费口舌了，安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not go through this exercise again, Anakin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要服从我的指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will pay attention to my lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不去查谁是凶手，我们还为什么被派到她这儿来呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why else do you think we were assigned to her if not to find the killer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.56,0:09:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护她是保安的差事，不是绝地武士的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protection is a job for local security, not Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤及无辜了，大师，我们的任务包含了追查凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's overkill, Master. Investigation is implied in our mandate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要严格执行参议会的指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will do exactly as the council has instructed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道你是来干么的，小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will learn your place, young one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只要你们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps with merely your presence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次恐吓行动就会疑云尽释\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mystery surrounding this threat will be revealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，如能蒙你们谅解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you'll excuse me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will retire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来了我感觉好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'll feel better having you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.43,0:09:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,每层楼我都会安排警卫站岗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have an officer stationed on every floor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.70,0:09:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己在楼下的控制中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll be in the control center downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:10:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,安，又见到你真开兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa busten wit happiness seein yousa again, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都快认不出我了，加加\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hardly even recognized me, JarJar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开她之后我天天都想着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought about her every day since we parted and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她把我全忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's forgotten me completely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shesa happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶好久没看她这么开心过啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happier den mesa seein her in a longo time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，你太看重负面的东西了，你得留心你的意念\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're focusing on the negative, Anakin. Be mindful of your thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她见到我们很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was pleased to see us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在去检查一下保安吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's check the security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我击中了飞船，但他们用了替身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit the ship, but they used a decoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.87,0:10:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我们得用更妙的手段，扎姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to try something more subtle this time, Zam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的委托人有点等得不耐烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My client is getting impatient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个，当心，这玩艺儿是剧毒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take these. Be careful. They're very poisonous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎姆，这次可别出什么错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Zam, there can be no mistakes this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰弗上尉在楼下安排了重兵把守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Typho has more than enough men downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺客绝对不会走这条路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No assassin would try that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿有什么情况吗？ - 毫无动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any activity up here? - Quiet as a tomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.23,0:11:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢就这样等着她出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like just waiting here for something to happen to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？ - 她遮住了镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - She covered the cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她肯定不喜欢我这么监视她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think she liked me watching her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么想的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给R2下指令，一旦有入侵者就来通知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She programmed R2 to warn us if there is an intruder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要杀一个参议员的方法很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many other ways to kill a senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，但我们不是要抓住这个刺客吗，师父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but we also want to catch this assassin, don't we, Master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在用她做诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're using her as bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was her idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心，她不会出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. No harm will come to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感应到那间房里发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sense everything going on in that room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.37,0:11:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too risky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.77,0:11:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外，你的感应也没那么灵敏，我的年轻徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, your senses aren't that attuned, my young apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的就很灵吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yours are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很疲倦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直睡不好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't sleep well anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你母亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道为什么我老梦到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I keep dreaming about her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,过段时间就会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dreams pass in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿梦到帕德梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd much rather dream about Padmé.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,重回她的身边已经…令人陶醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just being around her again is… intoxicating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,留心你的意念，安纳金，他们会背叛你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be mindful of your thoughts, Anakin. They betray you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经宣誓服从绝地法规…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've made a commitment to theJedi order…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣誓是不能轻易反悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a commitment not easily broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要记住，她是个政客，政客是不能相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't forget, she's a politician. They're not to be trusted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和参议会里的其它人不一样，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not like the others in the senate, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的经验是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my experience that senators focus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,议员们只会取悦能资助他们选举的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}only on pleasing those who fund their campaigns…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且可以完全无视民主的真义…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're in no means scared of forgetting the niceties of democracy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.61,0:12:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就为了得到赞助 - 别对我说教啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in order to get those funds. - Not another lecture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少别再提什么政客筹钱的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least not on the economics of politics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.34,0:13:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，你是一概而论\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides, you're generalizing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.17,0:13:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相看起来没就那么腐败\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chancellor doesn't appear to be corrupt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕裴丁是个老政客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Palpatine is a politician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现他很善于\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have observed that he is very clever…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,处理和迎合议员们的怒气和偏见\N{\fnArial\fs30}in following the passions and the prejudices of the senators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's a good man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也感觉应到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense it too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,待这儿别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧，夫人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right, milady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,[胡图族语]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的绝地武士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jedi poo doo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.15,0:16:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么这么慢？ - 哦，师父，你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What took you so long? - Oh, you know, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.55,0:16:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一时找不到我要的车… - 他在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I couldn't find a speeder I liked… - There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有敞篷座舱和足够速度的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the open cockpit and the right speed capabilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.06,0:16:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你肯多花功夫练剑而不是耍小聪明的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you spent as long practicing your saber techniques as you do your wit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的剑术就足以和尤达大师抗衡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would rival Master Yoda as a swordsman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我已经做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I already did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想得美，我年轻的徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only in your mind, my very young apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉高，安纳金，快拉高！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up, Anakin. Pull up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不喜欢你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I don't like it when you do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，师父 我忘了你不喜欢飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Master. I forgot you don't like flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.95,0:17:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是不喜欢，但你这么做和自杀没什么两样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind flying, but what you're doing is suicide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金！我跟你说了多少次了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin! How many times have I told you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,离电源耦合器远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay away from power couplings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真爽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？他往那边去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? He went that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师，如果我们再追下去的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, if we keep this chase going any longer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.67,0:18:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙会被逼急的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that creep is gonna end up deep-fried…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且，我个人更想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, personally, I'd like to find out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？受谁指使？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who he is and who he's working for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是条捷径，我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a shortcut… I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.65,0:19:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦，你把他跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you've lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.05,0:19:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常抱歉，大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm deeply sorry, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是条捷径，安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was some shortcut, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.22,0:19:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走的完全是另一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went completely the other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你再次证明了… - 对不起我失陪一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Once again you've proved… - If you'll excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.33,0:19:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最讨厌他这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate it when he does that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.94,0:21:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她进夜总会了，大师 - 耐心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She went into the club, Master. - Patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 运用你的原力，思考 - 对不起，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Use the Force. Think. - Sorry, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他进去是想躲起来，不是要逃走 - 是的，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He went in there to hide, not to run. - Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下次可别弄丢了 - 是，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Next time, try not to lose it. - Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.16,0:22:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 武器就是你的生命 - 我会尽力的，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This weapon is your life. - I try, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.23,0:22:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我觉得总有一天我会死在你手上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I get the feeling you're going to be the death of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别这么说，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我就像父亲一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the closest thing I have to a father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不听我的话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why don't you listen to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.65,0:22:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.69,0:22:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想“他”是个女的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he is a she…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她还会伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think she is a changeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.03,0:22:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话，你得加倍小心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case, be extra careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.70,0:22:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去找她吧 - 你去哪儿，师父？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go and find her. - Where are you going, Master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.27,0:22:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄杯喝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.31,0:22:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:22:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想买死亡之杖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna buy some death sticks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.61,0:23:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想向我兜售死亡之杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to sell me death sticks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.45,0:23:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想向你兜售死亡之杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to sell you death sticks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想回家反省你的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go home and rethink your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.69,0:23:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回家反省我的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go home and rethink my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.21,0:23:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.61,0:23:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士执行公务，回去继续喝酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jedi business. Go back to your drinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.38,0:24:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你要杀的是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who it was you were trying to kill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.69,0:24:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从纳布来的一个参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a senator from Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.52,0:24:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁是你的雇主？ - 只是工作而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And who hired you? - It was just a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.36,0:24:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,雇主是谁？告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who hired you? Tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.09,0:24:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个赏金猎人，名叫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a bounty hunter called…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.20,0:24:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wee shahnit… sleemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.25,0:24:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toxic dart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须追查这个赏金猎人，欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track down this bounty hunter you must, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.67,0:25:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的是，查出他的主子是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most importantly, find out who he's working for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.24,0:25:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米达拉参议员怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Senator Amidala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.31,0:25:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她仍然需要保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will still need protecting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的徒弟，交给他办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handle that your Padawan will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.91,0:25:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，你护送参议员回她的纳布母星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, escort the senator back to her home planet of Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.65,0:25:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那儿会很安全，不要用真名乘坐交通工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be safer there. And don't use registered transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.49,0:25:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,以难民的身份上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travel as refugees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.59,0:25:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为反对派的领导，参议员不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the leader of the opposition, it will be very difficult…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.59,0:25:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…轻易离开首都的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get Senator Amidala to leave the capital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.93,0:25:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们没抓住真凶之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until caught this killer is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.87,0:25:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她必须尊重我们的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}our judgment she must respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.37,0:25:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，你去参议院…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, go to the senate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.61,0:25:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请帕裴丁首相和她谈谈这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ask Chancellor Palpatine to speak with her about this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.68,0:25:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和她谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will talk with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.72,0:25:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米达拉参议员是不会拒绝行政命令的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Amidala will not refuse an executive order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很了解她，这你可以放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know her well enough to assure you of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.23,0:25:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Excellency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.39,0:26:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说，他们终于给了你一个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, they've finally given you an assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.83,0:26:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的耐心得到回报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your patience has paid off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.00,0:26:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的教导有功，并非我的耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guidance more than my patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.47,0:26:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无须指导，安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need guidance, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.14,0:26:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢的，你要学会相信自己的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}In time, you will learn to trust your feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.08,0:26:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候你就会战无不胜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you will be invincible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.32,0:26:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过很多次了：\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have said it many times:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.32,0:26:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我所见过的绝地武士里天分最高的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the most gifted Jedi I have ever met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.19,0:26:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Excellency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.19,0:26:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看你成为最伟大的绝地武士，安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you becoming the greatest of all theJedi, Anakin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至比尤达大师更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}even more powerful than Master Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.70,0:26:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为我徒弟担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am concerned for my Padawan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.84,0:26:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不具备独立执行这项任务的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not ready to be given this assignment on his own yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.67,0:26:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议会对这个决定是有信心的，欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The council is confident in its decision, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.01,0:26:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子有身具异能\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy has exceptional skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.08,0:26:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他还有很多要学，大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he still has much to learn, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.62,0:26:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的能力令他，唔，自以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}His abilities have made him, well, arrogant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.19,0:26:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错，不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.25,0:27:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这快成了绝地武士的通病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A flaw more and more common among Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.29,0:27:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,过分自信了，他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too sure of themselves they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.80,0:27:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,连年长些的，更有经验的也是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the older, more experienced ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.37,0:27:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，欧比旺，如果预言真的应验…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, Obi-Wan, if the prophecy is true…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.04,0:27:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你徒弟是唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}your apprentice is the only one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.85,0:27:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让原力恢复平衡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can bring the Force back into balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.78,0:27:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将缺席一段时日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking an extended leave of absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.71,0:27:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你代我负起议会的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be your responsibility to take my place in the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.95,0:27:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,代理人宾克斯，我信得过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Representative Binks, I know I can count on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.95,0:27:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸我能肩服如此重担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa honored to be taking on dissa heavy burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.82,0:27:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恭受此命，但是，嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesa accept this with muy, muy humility and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.23,0:27:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,加加，我不想给你带来麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}JarJar, I don't wish to hold you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.90,0:27:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you have a great deal to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.97,0:27:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.07,0:27:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.24,0:27:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢躲躲藏藏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not like this idea of hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.08,0:27:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.41,0:27:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然参议会已经发令调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that the council has ordered an investigation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.75,0:28:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺大师很快就会找到那个赏金猎人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it won't take Master Obi-Wan long to find this bounty hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.52,0:28:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了一年从事抵制建军法案的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't worked for a year to defeat the Military Creation Act…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.52,0:28:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不能在此决定它的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}to not be here when its fate is decided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.69,0:28:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我们不得不放弃尊严…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes we must let go of our pride…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.86,0:28:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我们不得不做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do what is requested of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.53,0:28:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，你长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, you've grown up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.83,0:28:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺大师不希望看到这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Obi-Wan manages not to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.88,0:28:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺是个好师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan is a great mentor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.81,0:28:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,与尤达大师一样睿智\N{\fnArial\fs30}As wise as Master Yoda and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.45,0:28:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,和温杜大师一样有力\N{\fnArial\fs30}as powerful as Master Windu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.95,0:28:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我作为他的徒弟很感激他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am truly thankful to be his apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.52,0:28:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某些方面… 许多方面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In some ways… a lot of ways…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.63,0:28:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实已经超越了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really ahead of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.33,0:28:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经准备好接受考验…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready for the trials…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.30,0:28:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他认为我难以捉摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he feels that I'm too unpredictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.80,0:28:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不让我继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't let me move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.57,0:28:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这肯定很令人沮丧 - 实际更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That must be frustrating. - It's worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.98,0:29:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是吹毛求疵，不听忠告\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's overly critical. He never listens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.88,0:29:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他… 他不能理解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.35,0:29:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不公平了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.55,0:29:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个师父都能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}All mentors have a way of seeing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.97,0:29:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不愿意承认的缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}more of our faults than we would like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.49,0:29:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样我们才能成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way we grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.59,0:29:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.00,0:29:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.37,0:29:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想一步登天\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't try to grow up too fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.00,0:29:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am grown up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.11,0:29:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.21,0:29:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你别这么看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't look at me like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.28,0:29:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.88,0:29:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我感觉很不自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me feel uncomfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.02,0:29:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.27,0:30:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你平安，夫人 - 谢谢你，上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be safe, milady. - Thank you, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.14,0:30:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好照看多弥，危险现在由你们俩承担了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take good care of Dormé. The threat's on you two now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.31,0:30:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我在一起很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be safe with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.71,0:30:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.45,0:30:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人，不是我的问题 我更担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me, milady. I worry about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.75,0:30:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一他们知道你离开了首都怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they realize you've left the capital?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.26,0:30:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，那么我的绝地守护者就不得不证明他有多厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then myJedi protector will have to prove how good he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.66,0:30:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.66,0:30:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没和我本人或议会商议之前千万别轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't do anything without first consulting either myself or the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.90,0:30:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.97,0:30:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人，我会尽快查出阴谋真相的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get to the bottom of this plot quickly, milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.60,0:30:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就可以回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be back here in no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.64,0:30:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如能尽快办妥，我感激不尽，绝地大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be most grateful for your speed, MasterJedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.98,0:30:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该动身了 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's time to go. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.98,0:30:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，愿原力与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, may the Force be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.61,0:30:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿原力与你同在，大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be with you, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.13,0:30:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我突然有点害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.10,0:31:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我头一次独立执行使命，我也有点害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my first assignment on my own. I am too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.14,0:31:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，有R2陪着我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. We have R2 with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.64,0:31:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望他别干蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do hope he doesn't try anything foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.95,0:31:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更担心她会干蠢事，而不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be more concerned about her doing something than him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.84,0:31:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人要见你，亲爱的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone to see ya, honey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.37,0:31:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个绝地武士，看起来像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jedi, by the looks of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.34,0:31:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.01,0:31:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，德克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.41,0:31:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐，我一会就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a seat. I'll be right with ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.42,0:31:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来杯乔瓦果汁好吗？ - 哦，好的，谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanna cup o'jawa juice? - Oh, yes. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.06,0:32:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老伙计！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old buddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.61,0:32:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友，我有什么可以效劳的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, my friend, what can I do for ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.67,0:32:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我这是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell me what this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.01,0:32:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，你知道吗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whattaya know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.35,0:32:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我上次在撒泊特瑞太空外沿探矿以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't seen one of these since I was prospectin'…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是头一次见到这玩艺儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}on Subterrel, beyond the outer rim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.19,0:32:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我它从哪儿来的吗？多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell me where it came from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.72,0:32:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是克隆人的玩艺儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This baby belongs to them cloners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.79,0:32:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿来的是一只卡米罗飞镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got here is a Kamino saberdart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.23,0:32:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪分析部门怎么没发现呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder why it didn't show up in the analysis archives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.30,0:32:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这些刀锋上有趣的小切口告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's these funny little cuts on the side that give it away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.70,0:32:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些分析机器人只会分析符号，嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those analysis droids only focus on symbols.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.74,0:32:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原以为你们绝地武士会更清楚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should think that you Jedi would have more respect…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,知识和智慧之间的区别呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the difference between knowledge and…wisdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.38,0:33:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，要是机器人也能思考…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if droids could think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.48,0:33:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就没有立足之地了，不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}there'd be none of us here, would there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.29,0:33:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡米罗，我从来没听说过它在共和国之内吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kamino. I'm not familiar with it. Is it in the Republic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.59,0:33:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不 他在太空外沿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. It's beyond the outer rim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.66,0:33:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是在瑞斯惑星之外大约12秒距（1秒＝3.26光年）的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say about 12 parsecs outside the Rishi Maze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.40,0:33:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很容易找，连你们部门里的机器人都找得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be easy to find, even for those droids in your archives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.90,0:33:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些卡米罗人与世隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Kaminoans keep to themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.74,0:33:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是克隆人，很完美的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're cloners. Damn good ones too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.78,0:33:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克隆人？他们友好吗？ - 那就看情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cloners. Are they friendly? - Depends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.28,0:33:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说，德克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on what, Dex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.32,0:33:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看你的态度如何…\N{\fnArial\fs30}On how good your manners are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.29,0:33:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的… 钱包有多鼓\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how big your… pocketbook is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.34,0:33:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要帮忙吗？ - 是的，是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you call for assistance? - Yes, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.14,0:33:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题，肯诺比大师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you having a problem, Master Kenobi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.37,0:34:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，嗯，我要找一个叫卡米罗的星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm looking for a planetary system called Kamino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.78,0:34:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡米罗 - 在档案星图里找不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kamino. - It doesn't show up on the archive charts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.15,0:34:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡米罗，这不是我熟悉的星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kamino. It's not a system I'm familiar with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.55,0:34:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定坐标没搞错吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you have the right coordinates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.02,0:34:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我的情报，它应该位于这个像限\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to my information, it should appear in this quadrant here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.12,0:34:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在瑞斯惑星的南面\N{\fnArial\fs30}just south of the Rishi Maze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.13,0:34:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不告诉你，好像你找的星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to say it, but it looks like the system you're searching for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.57,0:34:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.37,0:34:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能，也许是档案不全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible. Perhaps the archives are incomplete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.97,0:34:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们资料里没有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}If an item does not appear in our records…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.14,0:34:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是不存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it does not exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.00,0:35:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！！机器人不许进来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you! No droids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.60,0:35:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.35,0:35:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.01,0:35:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定很困难，作为一个绝地武士终生立誓…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be difficult, having sworn your life to the Jedi…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.02,0:35:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能去你喜欢的地方，做你喜欢的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}not being able to visit the places you like or do the things you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.02,0:35:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不能和你喜欢的人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or be with the people that I love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.09,0:35:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能恋爱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you allowed to love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.23,0:35:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想绝地武士是禁止恋爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was forbidden for a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.60,0:35:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,配偶，不许有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attachment is forbidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.70,0:35:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,财产，不许有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possession is forbidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.70,0:35:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怜悯，我把它定义为无条件的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compassion, which I would define as unconditional love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.41,0:35:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一个绝地武士生活的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}is central to a Jedi's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.31,0:35:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此你也可以说我们是被鼓励去爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you might say that we are encouraged to love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.78,0:35:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的变化真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've changed so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.82,0:35:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的变化真小\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't changed a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.49,0:35:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我梦中所见一般无二\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're exactly the way I remember you in my dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.00,0:36:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出手来，感应在你们周围的原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach out. Sense the Force around you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.84,0:36:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须运用你们的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your feelings you must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.95,0:36:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们，孩子们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Younglings. Younglings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.09,0:36:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来客人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A visitor we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.62,0:36:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，欧比旺大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Master Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.62,0:36:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.16,0:36:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉打扰了，大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to disturb you, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.79,0:36:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮上什么忙吗，欧比旺？嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What help can I be, Obi-Wan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找一位老友向我描述的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a planet described to me by an old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.60,0:36:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他，但这个星系在我们的档案星图里没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust him, but the systems don't show on the archive maps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.31,0:36:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一颗星球，欧比旺大师找不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost a planet Master Obi-Wan has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.28,0:36:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难为情！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How embarrassing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.68,0:36:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,利安，把帘子拉上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liam, the shades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.05,0:36:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都到星图阅读器这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather round the map reader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.62,0:36:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,澄心静虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear your minds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.89,0:37:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会找到欧比旺的不听话的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find Obi-Wan's wayward planet we will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.56,0:37:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它应该在…这儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ought to be here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.83,0:37:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这儿什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.83,0:37:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力将这一区域所有星球拉向这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravity is pulling all the stars in the area towards this spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.87,0:37:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力的影像还在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravity's silhouette remains…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.07,0:37:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这颗星和它所有行星的影像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the star and all the planets…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.14,0:37:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappeared they have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.24,0:37:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can this be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.58,0:37:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thought?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.15,0:37:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.49,0:37:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.02,0:37:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有人把它从档案内存里清除掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because someone erased it from the archive memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.23,0:37:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太棒了，孩子的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly wonderful the mind of a child is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.03,0:37:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Padawan is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.37,0:37:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,去引力中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the center of gravity's pull…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.54,0:37:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会找到你的星球，\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find your planet you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.42,0:38:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据肯定被清除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The data must have been erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.85,0:38:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，谁能在档案中清除资料呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who could empty information from the archives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.79,0:38:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不可能的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that impossible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.72,0:38:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个危险而恼人的谜，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangerous and disturbing this puzzle is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.23,0:38:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有绝地武士才能清除文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a Jedi could have erased those files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.70,0:38:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谁干的？为什么？很难回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who and why, harder to answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.20,0:38:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会深思这个问题的，\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meditate on this I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.90,0:38:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是有史以来最年轻的女皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't the youngest queen ever elected…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.30,0:38:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在回想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now that I think back on it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.10,0:38:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道自己的年龄是否足够\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I was old enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.00,0:38:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我是否准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I was ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.07,0:38:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为之服务的人民觉得你是称职的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people you served thought you did a good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.01,0:39:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说他们甚至想修改宪法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard they even tried to amend the constitution…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.18,0:39:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你继续留任\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you could stay in office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.35,0:39:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,两届任期满后我真是松了一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was relieved when my two terms were up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.95,0:39:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但女皇陛下让我担任参议员的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when the queen asked me to serve as senator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.75,0:39:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又难以拒绝她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't refuse her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.02,0:39:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赞同女皇的决定，我认为共和国很需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with her. I think the Republic needs you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.49,0:39:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你选择了继续服务大众\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad that you chose to serve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.64,0:39:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果参议院投票建军\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the senate votes to create an army, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.42,0:39:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定会让我们陷于内战\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's sure to push us into a civil war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.31,0:39:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unthinkable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.27,0:39:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未发生过大规模的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}There hasn't been a full-scale war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.97,0:39:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,自共和国成立以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the formation of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.78,0:39:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为有可能通过谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see any way through negotiations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.35,0:39:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让分裂派重回共和吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring the separatists back into the Republic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.55,0:39:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们有危机感，这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if they feel threatened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.85,0:39:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们会求助于贸易同盟或商业协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll turn to the Trade Federations or the Commerce Guilds for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.32,0:39:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,出乎意料的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's outrageous…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.39,0:39:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过最高法院四轮审讯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but after four trials in the Supreme Court…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.79,0:39:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽特·刚瑞仍然是贸易同盟总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nute Gunray is still the viceroy of the Trade Federation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.70,0:39:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕参议会无力解决这一危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear the senate is powerless to resolve this crisis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.84,0:40:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须对共和国有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must keep our faith in the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.88,0:40:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦不相信民主，我们就失去了民主\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day we stop believing democracy can work is the day we lose it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.05,0:40:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们祈祷永远不会有那么一天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pray that day never comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.85,0:40:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时，你还得考虑自身的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, we must consider your own safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.36,0:40:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么建议，绝地大师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your suggestion, Master Jedi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.73,0:40:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金还不是绝地武士 他还只是个学徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin's not a Jedi yet. He's still a Padawan learner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.20,0:40:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我想… - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I was thinking… - Hold on a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.16,0:40:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.53,0:40:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想也许我能在这个湖泊区待下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking I would stay in the lake country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.07,0:40:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有些地方人迹罕至\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some places up there that are very isolated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.40,0:40:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，在这儿我负责你的安全，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. I'm in charge of security here, milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.34,0:40:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.31,0:40:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再熟悉不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.27,0:40:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才会到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.34,0:40:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想明智的做法是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it would be wise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.41,0:40:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种情况下你听取听我的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you took advantage of my knowledge in this instance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.18,0:40:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.29,0:40:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，那么就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. It's settled, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.40,0:41:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿，R4，在它应该在的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is, R4, right where it should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.24,0:41:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失踪的卡米罗星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our missing planet Kamino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.25,0:41:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}MasterJedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.25,0:41:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相大人正恭候你的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prime minister is expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.82,0:42:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 首相知道我要来？ - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm expected? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.12,0:42:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他渴望与你会晤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is anxious to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.49,0:42:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了这么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all these years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.79,0:42:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都开始想你不会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were beginning to think you weren't coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.50,0:42:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, please, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.51,0:42:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我向你介绍拉马·苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present Lama Su…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.12,0:42:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡米罗星的首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}prime minister of Kamino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.89,0:42:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是绝地大师…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is MasterJedi…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.19,0:42:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺·肯诺比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.19,0:42:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你在这里会很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you're going to enjoy your stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.96,0:42:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.57,0:42:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在言归正传\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now to business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.87,0:42:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到我们的进度如期完成了一定会很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be delighted to hear that we are on schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.91,0:42:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十万个单位已整装待发\N{\fnArial\fs30}200, 000 units are ready…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.91,0:42:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一百万正在生产\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a million more well on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.41,0:42:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.48,0:43:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉你们的西佛·迪亚斯大师…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell your Master Sifo-Dyas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.72,0:43:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的订单会如期交货的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that his order will be met on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.19,0:43:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，哪位大师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Master…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.32,0:43:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地大师西佛·迪亚斯仍然…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jedi Master Sifo-Dyas is still…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.99,0:43:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,占据绝地议会的领导地位，是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}a leading member of theJedi Council, is he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.23,0:43:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,西佛·迪亚斯大师在十年前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Sifo-Dyas was killed almost ten years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.67,0:43:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到这消息我真难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry to hear that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.10,0:43:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确信他会为我们给他建造的军队而骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sure he would have been proud of the army we've built for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.51,0:43:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.94,0:43:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，一支复制军队，我必须说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, a clone army, and I must say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.71,0:43:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支我们所建造的最完美的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of the finest we've ever created.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.05,0:43:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我，首相大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Prime Minister…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.12,0:43:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的大师什么时候为军队的事和你联系的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when my master first contacted you about the army…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.72,0:43:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…他说了是为谁建造的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}did he say who it was for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.96,0:43:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.09,0:43:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为共和国建造的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}This army is for the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.63,0:43:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你一定急于亲自检阅一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you must be anxious to inspect the units for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.80,0:43:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我来的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.72,0:44:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前一放学就来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to come here for school retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.59,0:44:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会每天游到那个小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would swim to that island every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.00,0:44:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这湖水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.74,0:44:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会躺在沙滩上让阳光把身体晒乾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to lie out on the sand and let the sun dry us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.84,0:44:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜测鸟儿在唱什么歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and try to guess the names of the birds singing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.68,0:44:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢沙滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.42,0:44:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙子又粗又硬，让人很不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coarse and rough and irritating…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.52,0:44:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且弄得到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it gets everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.76,0:44:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的沙可不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.43,0:44:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里，一切都很柔软\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, everything is soft…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.53,0:44:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,光滑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and smooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.30,0:45:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.64,0:45:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have done that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.41,0:45:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.99,0:45:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.73,0:46:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你看了会高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hoped you would be pleased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,克隆人能独立思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clones can think creatively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.60,0:46:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会发现他们比机器人优越得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find that they are immensely superior to droids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.28,0:46:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们深以我们的战斗训练程序为傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take great pride in our combat education and training programs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.78,0:46:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一组是五年前创建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This group was created about five years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.25,0:46:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提到了加速生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mentioned growth acceleration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.42,0:46:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，是的，这很关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, it's essential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.46,0:46:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不，一个成熟的克隆人就需要一生的时间来生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, a mature clone would take a lifetime to grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.59,0:46:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们用一半的时间就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we can do it in half the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.30,0:46:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.07,0:46:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们绝对服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are totally obedient…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.07,0:46:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无异议地执行任何命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking any order without question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.87,0:46:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们改造了他们的遗传结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}We modified their genetic structure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.04,0:46:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们更为独立于母体\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make them less independent than the original host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么谁是母体呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who was the original host?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.05,0:46:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫强格·费特的赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bounty hunter called Jango Fett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.72,0:46:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这个赏金猎人在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where is this bounty hunter now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.92,0:46:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我们把他留下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we keep him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.72,0:47:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了要支付他高昂的佣金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from his pay, which is considerable…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.66,0:47:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,费特只有一个要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fett demanded only one thing:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.26,0:47:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本人的纯复制\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unaltered clone for himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.96,0:47:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很奇怪，是吧？ - “纯复制”？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Curious, isn't it? - "Unaltered"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.50,0:47:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯的基因复制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure genetic replication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.14,0:47:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不做任何令之顺服的结构改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tampering with the structure to make it more docile…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.41,0:47:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不加速生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no growth acceleration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.08,0:47:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想见见这位强格·费特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should very much like to meet this Jango Fett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.45,0:47:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴为你安排会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be very happy to arrange it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.30,0:47:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很壮观，不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnificent, aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.00,0:47:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.07,0:47:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定知道，只是不想告诉我罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you do. You just don't want to tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.33,0:48:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,想对我用什么绝地猜心术吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna use one of your Jedi mind tricks on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.80,0:48:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只对意志薄弱的人有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only work on the weak-minded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.31,0:48:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.08,0:48:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时12岁 他叫保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 12. His name was Palo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.94,0:48:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同在青年立法组织会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were both in the Legislative Youth Program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.95,0:48:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比我大几岁 很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a few years older than I. Very cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.12,0:48:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色的卷发，梦一样的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark, curly hair. Dreamy eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.99,0:48:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了，我可以想像\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I get the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.95,0:48:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他后来怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.46,0:48:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从政，他则选择了艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went into public service. He went on to become an artist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.29,0:48:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他更聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he was the smart one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.46,0:48:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢搞政治的，是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't like politicians, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.83,0:48:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,政客里面我只喜欢两叁个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like two or three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.10,0:48:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其中一个我一直琢磨不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not really sure about one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.18,0:48:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为政治体制没有正常运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think the system works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.48,0:48:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能让它正常运作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you have it work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.62,0:48:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要体制是政治家们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a system where the politicians…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.52,0:48:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在一起并讨论问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}sit down and discuss the problem…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.86,0:48:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,以全体人民利益为原则达成共识…\N{\fnArial\fs30}agree what's in the best interest of all the people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.49,0:48:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后加以实行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.96,0:48:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正是这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.33,0:48:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是我们的政策人民不是都能拥护\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trouble is that people don't always agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.46,0:48:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔，那么就该强制执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then they should be made to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.47,0:49:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁来执行？谁来强制他们？ - 我不知道 总会有人做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By whom? Who's gonna make them? - I don't know. Someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.64,0:49:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你吗？ - 肯定不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You? - Of course not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.80,0:49:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是某个人 - 某个聪明人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But someone. - Someone wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.87,0:49:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这在我看来太像专政独裁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds an awful lot like a dictatorship to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.18,0:49:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔，只要它有效就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.52,0:49:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在逗我玩吗？ - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're making fun of me. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.42,0:49:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么敢逗一个参议员玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be much too frightened to tease a senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.33,0:50:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,安！安，你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.17,0:50:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯巴，你父亲在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boba, is your father here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.24,0:50:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.37,0:50:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能见见他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.04,0:50:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.95,0:50:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸，唐尔温来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, Taun We's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.26,0:51:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,强格，欢迎你回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jango, welcome back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.06,0:51:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的旅行有收获吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was your trip productive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.10,0:51:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.14,0:51:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是绝地大师欧比旺 肯诺比\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jedi Master Obi-Wan Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.07,0:51:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是来检查我们进度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's come to check on our progress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.21,0:51:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的克隆人相当棒，你一定引以为傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your clones are very impressive. You must be very proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.21,0:51:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个普通人，在星际间混口饭吃而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a simple man trying to make my way in the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.32,0:51:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去过星际内部远至克罗斯肯混过饭吃吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever made your way as far into the interior as Coruscant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.95,0:51:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去过一两次 - 最近吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Once or twice. - Recently?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.16,0:51:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.96,0:51:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你一定认识西佛·迪亚斯大师了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you must know Master Sifo-Dyas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.67,0:51:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯巴，关上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boba, rood eht so-heeck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.90,0:51:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位大师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.34,0:51:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,西佛·迪亚斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sifo-Dyas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.47,0:51:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这位绝地武士雇你们干这活的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he not theJedi who hired you for this job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.08,0:52:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.85,0:52:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.09,0:52:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是被一个叫泰瑞安斯的人招过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was recruited by a man called Tyranus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.50,0:52:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一颗博格登德卫星上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on one of the moons of Bogden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.16,0:52:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.83,0:52:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对你的军队还满意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like your army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.87,0:52:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我期待见到他们真正的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look forward to seeing them in action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.10,0:52:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会干得很出色的，我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll do their job well. I'll guarantee that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.61,0:52:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你抽出时间来见我，强格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your time, Jango.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.51,0:52:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能会见绝地武士总是件愉快的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always a pleasure to meet a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.00,0:52:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思，爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.64,0:52:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾好东西，我们要上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack your things. We're leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.38,0:53:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我遇到他们的时候，我们开始激烈的交涉，谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I got to them, we went into aggressive negotiations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.98,0:53:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,“激烈的交涉”？为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Aggressive negotiations"? What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.12,0:53:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，为了一支光剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, negotiations with a lightsaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.60,0:53:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是欧比旺大师看到我这么做，他会气疯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Master Obi-Wan caught me doing this, he'd be very grumpy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.10,0:54:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我见到你的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the moment I met you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.43,0:54:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}all those years ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.04,0:54:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无日无夜不在想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a day has gone by when I haven't thought of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.78,0:54:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在与你再次相聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that I'm with you again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.81,0:54:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我苦恼倍增\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in agony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.32,0:54:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你越亲近情况越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The closer I get to you, the worse it gets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.29,0:54:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一想到不能跟你在一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thought of not being with you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.59,0:54:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就令我无法呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.40,0:54:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被那个吻缠住了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm haunted by the kiss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.43,0:54:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个你永远不该给我的吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you should never have given me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.84,0:54:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心灵悸动…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart is beating…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.27,0:54:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这个吻不会成为一道伤疤\N{\fnArial\fs30}hoping that that kiss will not become a scar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.41,0:54:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我心灵深处…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in my very soul…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.41,0:54:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我痛苦不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}tormenting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.92,0:54:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能怎么做？我愿做你吩咐的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do? I will do anything that you ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.37,0:55:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你与我一样身受煎熬，求求你，告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are suffering as much as I am, please, tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.84,0:55:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.84,0:55:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能 这是…不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't. It's… just not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.01,0:55:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事都有可能，帕德梅，听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything is possible, Padmé. Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.11,0:55:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.78,0:55:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们生活在现实世界，回到现实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live in a real world. Come back to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.49,0:55:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在学习成为一个绝地武士，而我… 我是一个参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're studying to become a Jedi. I'm a senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.06,0:55:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你再放任你的念头\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you follow your thoughts through to conclusion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.66,0:55:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会让我们误入歧途的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll take us to a place we cannot go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.40,0:55:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们对彼此的感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}regardless of the way we feel about each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.73,0:55:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你还是有感觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you do feel something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.87,0:55:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你为我放弃大好前途\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not let you give up your future for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.01,0:55:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要求我理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are asking me to be rational.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.31,0:55:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事正是我清楚我做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is something I know I cannot do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.68,0:55:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我，我也希望我能放下感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I wish that I could just wish away my feelings…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.42,0:56:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.39,0:56:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我不会让步的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not give in to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.23,0:56:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，你知道，这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.57,0:56:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以不必如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wouldn't have to be that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.50,0:56:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以不让外人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could keep it a secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.77,0:56:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会生活在谎言中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be living a lie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.87,0:56:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个就算我们想保守也无法保守的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}one we couldn't keep even if we wanted to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.28,0:56:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.68,0:56:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能吗，安纳金？你能这么活着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you, Anakin? Could you live like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.52,0:56:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能，你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.02,0:56:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会毁了我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would destroy us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.47,0:56:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请转告你们参议会第一支军队已经准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your council that the first battalions are ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.77,0:56:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,再提醒他们，如果需要更多的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remind them, if they need more troops…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.97,0:56:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就需要更多的时间培育他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will take more time to grow them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.24,0:57:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住了，谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't forget, and thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.11,0:57:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.23,0:57:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,R4！\N{\fnArial\fs30}R4!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.47,0:57:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,用5号码加密接通克罗斯肯，当心这是他们的老巢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scramble code five to Coruscant, care of the old folks' home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.34,0:57:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已与卡米罗首相成功接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have successfully made contact with the prime minister of Kamino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.78,0:57:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在用一个名叫强格·费特的赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are using a bounty hunter named Jango Fett{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.23,0:57:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,建造一支复制军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}to create a clone army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.78,0:57:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我强烈感觉到这个赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a strong feeling that this bounty hunter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.35,0:57:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们在找的刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the assassin we are looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.59,0:57:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这些克隆人牵涉了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think these cloners are involved…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.66,0:57:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺杀阿米达拉参议员的阴谋有关吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the plot to assassinate Senator Amidala?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.83,0:57:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，大师，看不出有什么动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Master. There appears to be no motive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.83,0:57:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事都不能想当然，欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not assume anything, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.83,0:57:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须澄心静虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear your mind must be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.93,0:58:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想找出这个阴谋幕后的罪魁祸首的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you are to discover the real villains behind this plot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.21,0:58:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.17,0:58:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说西佛·迪亚斯大师订购了这支复制军队…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say Master Sifo-Dyas placed an order for a clone army…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.34,0:58:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多十年前以参议会的名义\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the request of the senate almost ten years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.82,0:58:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我似乎记得他在这之前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was under the impression he was killed before that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.79,0:58:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议会曾经授意建造复制军队吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the council ever authorize the creation of a clone army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.39,0:58:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 不管是谁订购的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Whoever placed that order…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.39,0:58:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没得到绝地参议会的批淮\N{\fnArial\fs30}did not have the authorization of theJedi Council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.79,0:58:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带来 我们要盘问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him here. Question him we will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.73,0:58:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，大师，等我抓到他再向你报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Master. I will report back when I have him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.34,0:58:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真是瞎了眼了，要是连建造这样一支复制军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blind we are if creation of this clone army…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.01,0:58:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could not see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.51,0:58:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是到了要告知议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it is time we informed the senate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.82,0:58:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们运用原力的能力，已经削弱了的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that our ability to use the Force has diminished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.72,0:58:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有黑暗之君西斯知道我们的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the dark lord of the Sith knows of our weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.19,0:58:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果告知参议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}If informed the senate is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.56,0:58:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会增加我们的敌对者\N{\fnArial\fs30}multiply our adversaries will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.66,0:59:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.73,0:59:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.30,0:59:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.57,0:59:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想打扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to disturb you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.87,0:59:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了我安心多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your presence is soothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.74,0:59:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚又做恶梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had another nightmare last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.05,0:59:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士不会做恶梦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jedi don't have nightmares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.95,0:59:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你的梦话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.89,1:00:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.90,1:00:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在受罪，帕德梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is suffering, Padmé.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.43,1:00:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚地见到她，就像现在见到你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw her as clearly as I see you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.95,1:00:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is in pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.59,1:00:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我这么做悖离了保护你的指令，参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm disobeying my mandate to protect you, Senator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.09,1:00:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.03,1:00:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去帮助她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to help her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.76,1:00:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.77,1:00:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I don't have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.15,1:00:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸，小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.65,1:01:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯巴，上飞船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boba, get on board!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.36,1:02:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，这可不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.69,1:04:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,[胡图族语]
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.66,1:04:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.19,1:04:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okey-okey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.56,1:04:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[胡图族语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chut-chut, Watto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.33,1:04:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.60,1:04:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你想干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.07,1:04:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！你是个绝地武士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! You're a Jedi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.68,1:04:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么，我什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, I didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.55,1:04:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找雪米·天行者（安纳金的母亲）\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Shmi Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.52,1:05:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.06,1:05:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Ani?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.77,1:05:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nahhh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.54,1:05:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是安！真的是你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Ani! It is you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.64,1:05:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长高多了，嗯？哇喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure sprouted, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.74,1:05:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个绝地武士！你知道吗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Jedi! Whattaya know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.55,1:05:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能帮我教训几个赖账不还的臭流氓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could help with some deadbeats who owe me a lot of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.55,1:05:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.12,1:05:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，是的 雪米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Shmi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.09,1:05:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不属于我了… 不再是了，我把她卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not mine… a no more-a. I sold her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.43,1:05:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把她卖了？ - 好几年前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sold her? - Years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.83,1:05:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，安，但你知道，生意就是生意，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Ani, but you know, business is business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.07,1:05:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我把她卖给一个湿地农场主，嗯，叫拉斯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sold her to a moisture farmer named Lars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.94,1:05:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我想他叫拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I think it was Lars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.08,1:05:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,信不信由你，我听说他给了她自由还娶了她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not, I heard he freed her and married her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.68,1:05:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然有这等事，嗯？是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can ya beat that, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.48,1:06:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们现在在哪里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where they are now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.62,1:06:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这儿可远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long way from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.66,1:06:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是在摩斯·埃斯里另一侧的什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace over on the other side of Mos Eisley, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.26,1:06:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.93,1:06:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，这不成问题！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Absolutely!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.77,1:06:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看我的记录，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go look at my records, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.19,1:06:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们被跟踪了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! I think we're being tracked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.36,1:06:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是在我们船体上放了导航装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have put a homing device on our hull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.90,1:06:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳，儿子，我们要进小行星区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, son. We'll move into the asteroid field…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.30,1:07:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给他几个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll have a couple of surprises for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.15,1:07:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,震波弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seismic charges!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.21,1:07:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.87,1:07:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎不接受教训，这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't seem to take a hint, this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.03,1:08:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.15,1:08:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他，爸！开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him, Dad! Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.79,1:08:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！这就是我不喜欢飞行的原因！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast! This is why I hate flying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.41,1:08:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打中他了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.01,1:08:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们务必要解决掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just have to finish him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.47,1:09:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,R4，准备把废弃的零件抛出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}R4, prepare to jettison the spare part canisters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.01,1:09:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire them now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.96,1:09:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，这下我们再也不会见到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't be seeing him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.97,1:10:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，R4，我想我们在这里藏得够久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, R4, I think we've waited long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.59,1:10:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪有那么多贸易联邦的飞船停在这里，R4\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an unusual concentration of Federation ships over there, R4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.63,1:11:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在飞船上，R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with the ship, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.18,1:11:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我能为您效劳吗？我是 C…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. How might I be of service? I am C…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.18,1:11:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO？\N{\fnArial\fs30}3PO?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.95,1:11:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的创造者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The maker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.92,1:11:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，主人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Ani!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.66,1:11:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你一定会回来的 我早就知道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you would return. I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.59,1:11:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有帕德梅小姐 哦，我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Miss Padmé. Oh, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.43,1:11:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，3PO\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, 3PO.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.13,1:11:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑我的电路板！能见到你们俩我太高兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless my circuits! I'm so pleased to see you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.13,1:12:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来见我母亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to see my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.94,1:12:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想还是先进去再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think perhaps we'd better go indoors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.94,1:12:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧文主人，我荣幸的向您介绍两位尊贵的来客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Owen, might I present two most important visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.55,1:12:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天行者安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Anakin Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.12,1:12:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是欧文·拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owen Lars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.85,1:12:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的女友，贝露 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is my girlfriend, Beru. - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.15,1:12:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是帕德梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Padmé.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.52,1:12:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你是我的继母的孩子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm your stepbrother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.03,1:12:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直有一种感觉，总有一天你会出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a feeling you might show up someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.70,1:12:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的母亲在这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my mother here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.53,1:12:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，她不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.47,1:12:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,克力格·拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cliegg Lars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.30,1:12:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shmi is my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.41,1:12:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进屋去，有许多事情要谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go inside. We have a lot to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.05,1:12:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在破晓之前，他们从四面八方包围过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just before dawn. They came out of nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.25,1:12:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是塔斯肯人盗贼的一次狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hunting party ofTusken Raiders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.16,1:12:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天你母亲很早就出门了，她每天如此…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother had gone out early, like she always did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.16,1:13:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是去摘蘑菇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pick mushrooms that grow on the vaporators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.23,1:13:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她的脚印可以看出，她大约是在走了一半的路程时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the tracks, she was about halfway home…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.90,1:13:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓住她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they took her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.40,1:13:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些塔斯肯人像人类一样行走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those Tuskens walk like men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.57,1:13:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们都是邪恶，愚蠢的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're vicious, mindless monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.01,1:13:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派出了30个人去找他，只有四个人回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty of us went out after her. Four of us came back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.02,1:13:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本应和他们一起去的，但是自从我的腿断了以后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be out there with them, but after I lost my leg…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.25,1:13:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的腿治好之前，我不能够再驾驶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just couldn't ride anymore until I heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.76,1:13:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想放弃寻找…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to give up on her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.83,1:13:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她已经被夺走有一个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she's been gone a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.80,1:13:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着的机会十分渺茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's little hope she's lasted this long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.61,1:13:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到哪儿去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.08,1:13:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找回我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.31,1:13:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的母亲已经死了，孩子，接受这个事实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother's dead, son. Accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.34,1:14:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.44,1:14:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是好人，帕德梅，在这里你会很安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are good people, Padmé. You'll be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.78,1:14:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.76,1:14:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.70,1:16:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须说服商业协会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must persuade the Commerce Guild…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.80,1:16:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,和贸易联邦签署协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Corporate Alliance to sign the treaty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.31,1:16:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳布星的参议员怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the senator from Naboo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.74,1:16:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she dead yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.48,1:16:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我没有看到她的人头，我就不会签署这份协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not signing your treaty until I have her head on my desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.55,1:16:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个从不食言的人，总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a man of my word, Viceroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.95,1:16:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你拥有这些我们为您制造的机器人战士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}With these new battle droids we've built for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.12,1:16:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,您就拥有了银河系最强大的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll have the finest army in the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.24,1:17:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我先前所说的那样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I explained to you earlier…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.24,1:17:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信还会再有超过一万个星系…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am quite convinced that 10, 000 more systems…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.57,1:17:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我们，只要我能得到各位的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}will rally to our cause with your support, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.31,1:17:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]你的计划是一种叛国\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are proposing could be construed as treason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.18,1:17:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们科技工会的军队…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Techno Union army…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.15,1:17:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意听从您的调遣，伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}is at your disposal, Count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.79,1:17:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,银行同业会愿意签署协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Banking Clan will sign your treaty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.43,1:17:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.43,1:17:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来自贸易联邦的朋友也答应给予他们的支持…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our friends from the Trade Federation have pledged their support…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.20,1:17:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到他们的机器人战士与你们的会合之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when their battle droids are combined with yours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.94,1:17:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将拥有银河系最强大的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall have an army greater than any in the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.81,1:17:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士将会被彻底击败\N{\fnArial\fs30}TheJedi will be overwhelmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.58,1:17:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国将不得不满足我们的任何要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Republic will agree to any demands we make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.24,1:18:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈？ 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.68,1:18:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.88,1:18:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.92,1:19:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.69,1:19:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了，妈妈，你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here, Mom. You're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.69,1:19:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.56,1:19:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ani?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.63,1:19:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，你长得真帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look so handsome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.04,1:19:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.24,1:19:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grown-up son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.54,1:19:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真为你感到自豪，安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so proud of you, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.91,1:19:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.58,1:19:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要离开你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I am complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.73,1:19:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love y…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.93,1:19:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别离开我，妈妈，一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me, Mom. Everything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.17,1:19:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.77,1:19:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.33,1:20:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.90,1:20:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.75,1:21:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.49,1:21:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦，挣扎…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain, suffering…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.53,1:21:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到了死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}death I feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.07,1:21:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了一件可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something terrible has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.87,1:21:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的天行者正在痛苦之中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Skywalker is in pain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.01,1:21:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨大的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrible pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.68,1:21:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射器工作正常，但是我们收不到任何回覆的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transmitter is working, but we're not receiving a return signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.42,1:21:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗斯肯太远了，R4，你能加大功率吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coruscant's too far. R4, can you boost the power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.72,1:21:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有试试其他方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to try something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.63,1:21:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以联系纳布星上的安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can contact Anakin on Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.77,1:22:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里离我们近许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's much closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.27,1:22:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金？安纳金，回话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.71,1:22:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是欧比旺·肯诺比，安纳金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Obi-Wan Kenobi. Anakin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.77,1:22:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在纳布星上，R4\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not on Naboo, R4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.65,1:22:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我试试看把频率范围扩大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to try and widen the range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.25,1:22:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他不要出什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do hope nothing's happened to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.73,1:22:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是安纳金的讯号，好了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Anakin's tracking signal, all right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.73,1:22:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是讯号来自塔图因星\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's coming from Tatooine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.77,1:22:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the blazes is he doing there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.47,1:22:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫他待在纳布星的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him to stay on Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.94,1:22:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't got much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.74,1:22:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金？安纳金，收到没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.91,1:22:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是欧比旺·肯诺比\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Obi-Wan Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.86,1:22:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的讯息转送到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retransmit this message…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.86,1:23:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，收到没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.63,1:23:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的远程发报机被打坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My long-range transmitter has been knocked out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.10,1:23:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这份讯号转送到克罗斯肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retransmit this message to Coruscant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.98,1:23:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你拿来些吃的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.08,1:23:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.98,1:23:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,变速器坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shifter broke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.82,1:24:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我修东西的时候总是感觉生活变得如此的简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life seems so much simpler when you're fixing things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.06,1:24:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很擅长修理，一直如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good at fixing things. Always was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.90,1:24:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我却不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.87,1:24:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么她会死呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd she have to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.28,1:24:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我救不了她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why couldn't I save her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.51,1:24:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我本来应该能救她的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I could have!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.38,1:24:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时侯有些东西是修不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes there are things no one can fix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.59,1:24:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是全能的，安 - 是吗，我应该是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not all-powerful, Ani. - Well, I should be!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.03,1:24:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天我会是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday I will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.36,1:24:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为有史以来最强大的绝地武士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be the most powerfulJedi ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.70,1:24:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.47,1:24:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会学会怎样去拯救人们的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will even learn to stop people from dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.04,1:24:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.61,1:24:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是欧比旺的错！他嫉妒我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all Obi-Wan's fault! He's jealous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.71,1:25:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是束缚我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's holding me back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.12,1:25:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事，安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, Ani?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.93,1:25:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.64,1:25:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了他们所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.44,1:25:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.44,1:25:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.68,1:25:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不光是男人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not just the men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.58,1:25:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有女人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the women…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.75,1:25:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,和孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the children too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.62,1:25:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就像畜牲一样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like animals…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.79,1:25:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像屠宰畜牲一样的杀了他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I slaughtered them like animals!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.76,1:25:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.61,1:26:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,愤怒是人类的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be angry is to be human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.68,1:26:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我是个绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.69,1:26:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我不是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm better than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.57,1:26:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道无论你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know wherever you are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.83,1:26:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方将变得更美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's become a better place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.21,1:26:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这个世界中一个男人所能找到的最慈爱的伴侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the most loving partner a man could ever have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.31,1:26:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别了，我亲爱的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, my darling wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.35,1:26:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,并感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.58,1:27:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不够强大来挽救你的生命，妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't strong enough to save you, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.35,1:27:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't strong enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.79,1:27:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我发誓我不会再失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I promise I won't fail again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.11,1:27:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.55,1:27:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此的想念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.39,1:27:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2？你来这里干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2? What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.99,1:28:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它好像带来了一个叫做欧比旺·肯诺比的人的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems that he is carrying a message from an Obi-Wan Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.23,1:28:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,安，这个名字是你认识的人的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Ani, does that name mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.50,1:28:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，我的远程发射器坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin, my long-range transmitter has been knocked out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.07,1:28:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的讯息转送到克罗斯肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retransmit this message to Coruscant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.81,1:28:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一路追踪那个赏金猎人，强格·菲特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have tracked the bounty hunter, Jango Fett…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.15,1:28:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直到了吉诺西斯星的机器人工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the droid foundries on Geonosis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.42,1:28:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,贸易联邦打算向这里派送一支机器人大军…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trade Federation is to take delivery of a droid army here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.15,1:28:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很清楚，刚雷总督…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is clear that Viceroy Gunray…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.26,1:28:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是企图暗杀阿米达拉参议员的幕后指使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}is behind the assassination attempts on Senator Amidala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.86,1:28:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,商业协会和贸易联邦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Commerce Guilds and the Corporate Alliance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.13,1:28:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,都同意将他们的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}have both pledged their armies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.96,1:28:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,交由杜库伯爵指挥，并正在组成…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Count Dooku and are forming…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.93,1:28:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.81,1:28:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到在吉诺西斯星上发生的事比我们已知的还要多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More happening on Geonosis, I feel, than has been revealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.55,1:28:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.72,1:29:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金，我们会对付杜库伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will deal with Count Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.12,1:29:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最重要的任务就是待在原地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most important thing for you is to stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.79,1:29:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价保护参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect the senator at all costs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.63,1:29:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的首要任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is your first priority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.60,1:29:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白，大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.67,1:29:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不可能及时赶到那里去营救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never get there in time to save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.70,1:29:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要穿越半个银河系之远 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to come halfway across the galaxy. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.14,1:29:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉诺西斯星离这里只有不到一个秒差的距离\N（注：1秒差＝3.26光年＝30000000000000公里）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geonosis is less than a parsec away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.35,1:29:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他还活着的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.22,1:29:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算就坐在这里让他等死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you just gonna sit here and let him die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.99,1:29:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是你的朋友，你的师父 - 他就像是我的父亲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's your friend, your mentor. - He's like my father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.69,1:29:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你也听到了温杜大师的话，他命令我必须待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you heard Master Windu. He gave me strict orders to stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.49,1:29:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他命令你必须保护我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave you strict orders to protect me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.83,1:29:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我要去救欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm going to help Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.40,1:29:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你打算保护我，那么你就必须和我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you plan to protect me, you'll just have to come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.01,1:29:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不害怕，R2，只不过我以前从来没乘过飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not worried, R2. It's just I've never flown before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.45,1:30:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,商业协会正在备战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Commerce Guilds are preparing for war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.94,1:30:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can be no doubt of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.52,1:30:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜库伯爵一定已经和他们签定了协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count Dooku must have made a treaty with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.59,1:30:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,[外星语]辩论已经结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}The debate is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.10,1:30:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们需要那支克隆人大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we need that clone army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.20,1:30:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是辩论还未结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, the debate is not over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.24,1:30:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员是不会批准使用克隆人部队的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The senate will never approve the use of clones…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.77,1:30:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在分裂分子正式发动进攻前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the separatists attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.64,1:30:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a crisis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.64,1:30:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要让参议院通过投票赋予首相大人非常时期领导权\N{\fnArial\fs30}The senate must vote the chancellor emergency powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.88,1:30:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他才能有权批准制造克隆人部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can then approve the creation of an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.28,1:30:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是哪位参议员会有如此的勇气…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what senator would have the courage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.58,1:30:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来提议这样一份激进的法案呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to propose such a radical amendment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.25,1:30:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果… 阿米达拉参议员在这里就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only Senator Amidala were here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.75,1:31:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.08,1:31:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，你弄错了，我的朋友，这是个误会，很大的误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, my friend. This is a mistake, a terrible mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.35,1:31:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做的太过分了，真是疯狂的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have gone too far. This is madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.52,1:31:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是这里的领导人，杜库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were the leader here, Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.26,1:31:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证我与此事毫无瓜葛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This had nothing to do with me, I assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.96,1:31:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会立即请求他们将你释放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will petition immediately to have you set free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.50,1:31:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，我希望能快一点 我还有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope it doesn't take too long. I have work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.27,1:31:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是否能够请问，像您这样一位绝地武士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask why a Jedi knight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.17,1:31:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会来到这个偏僻的星球，吉诺西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}is all the way out here on Geonosis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.71,1:31:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一路的追踪一个叫强格·费特的赏金猎人来到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been tracking a bounty hunter named Jango Fett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.71,1:31:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.48,1:31:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里从未看到过任何赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no bounty hunters here that I am aware of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.38,1:31:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉诺西斯人不信任赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Geonosians don't trust them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.45,1:31:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很正常，但是他就在这里，这点我很肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can blame them? But he is here, I can assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.45,1:31:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是遗憾，我们以前从未能够谋面，欧比旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a great pity our paths have never crossed before, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.29,1:31:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,魁刚金一直给与你很高的赞扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui-Gon always spoke very highly of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.63,1:32:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望他还在人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish he were still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.14,1:32:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话他现在就能助我一臂之力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use his help right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.71,1:32:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,魁刚金绝无可能与你合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qui-Gon Jinn would never join you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.98,1:32:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别轻易的下结论，我年轻的绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure, my young Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.98,1:32:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你忘了他曾经是我的徒弟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget that he was once my apprentice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.65,1:32:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你曾经是他的徒弟一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as you were once his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.65,1:32:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于参议院内的腐败他一清二楚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew all about the corruption in the senate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.95,1:32:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不会去服从参议院的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he wouldn't have gone along with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.47,1:32:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他像我一样了解事实真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he had learned the truth as I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.09,1:32:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 事实真相？ - 对，事实真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The truth? - The truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.27,1:32:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你整个共和国现在已受制于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I told you that the Republic was now under the control…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.67,1:32:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,西斯黑暗大君的掌控之下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the dark lord of the Sith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.87,1:32:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，那绝不可能，绝地武士会肯定会察觉到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not possible. The Jedi would be aware of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.84,1:32:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗原力的浓雾已经蒙蔽了他们的洞察力，我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dark side of the Force has clouded their vision, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.21,1:32:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,成百的参议员已经…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds of senators are now under the influence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.88,1:32:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个名为达斯·西迪斯的黑暗大帝的控制之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a Sith lord called Darth Sidious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.59,1:32:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.29,1:32:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,贸易联邦的总督…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The viceroy of the Trade Federation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.76,1:33:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经与达斯·西迪斯结盟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}was once in league with this Darth Sidious…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.86,1:33:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是十年前他被黑暗大帝出卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was betrayed ten years ago by the dark lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.80,1:33:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来找我求助，他告诉了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came to me for help. He told me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.94,1:33:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要与我合作，欧比旺…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must join me, Obi-Wan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.21,1:33:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们一起来消灭西斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and together we will destroy the Sith!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.91,1:33:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会与你合作，杜库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never join you, Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.73,1:33:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来要释放你会变得很困难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be difficult to secure your release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.27,1:33:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分肯定的是这些分裂分子已经签定了一份公约…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's-a clear desa separatists made a pact…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.28,1:33:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中包括贸易联邦\N{\fnArial\fs30}wesa desa Federation du Trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.05,1:33:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸位参议员们，“行动起来”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senators, "dellow felagates":{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.45,1:33:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此共和国面临的迫在眉睫的危机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In response to this direct threat to the Republic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.59,1:34:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提议参议院…\N{\fnArial\fs30}mesa propose that the senate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.42,1:34:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即将非常时期领导权赋予…\N{\fnArial\fs30}give immediately emergency powers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.13,1:34:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the supreme chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.83,1:34:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕裴丁！帕裴丁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Palpatine! Palpatine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.07,1:34:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！ 请大家恢复秩序！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order! We shall have order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.01,1:34:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分为难的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is with great reluctance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.45,1:34:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受这项请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I have agreed to this calling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.92,1:34:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我热爱民主，我热爱共和国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love democracy. I love the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.72,1:34:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸位赋予我的权力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power you give me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.03,1:34:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在此次危机缓和之后交还\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will lay down when this crisis has abated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.03,1:34:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为对于我所拥有的权力的首次使用…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as my first act with this new authority…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.97,1:34:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将批准为共和国建立一支强大的军队…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will create a grand army of the Republic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.48,1:34:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,以应付分裂分子愈来愈近的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}to counter the increasing threats of the separatists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.62,1:35:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此一来，一切已经决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is done, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.79,1:35:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带领所有剩下的绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take what Jedi we have left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.62,1:35:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶往吉诺西斯去营救欧比旺大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go to Geonosis and help Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.56,1:35:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去查访一下卡米罗星上的克隆人，嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visit I will the cloners on Kamino…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.50,1:35:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去亲眼看一下他们为共和国建立的这支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see this army they have created for the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.86,1:35:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见前方的烟柱了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See those columns of steam straight ahead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.02,1:35:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是通风管排出的废气\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're exhaust vents of some type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.93,1:35:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.37,1:36:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，不管发生什么事情，你都要服从我的指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, whatever happens out there, follow my lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.41,1:36:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想在这里和他们开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested in getting into a war here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.61,1:36:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为参议院的成员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a member of the senate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.38,1:36:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我能通过外交方式解决争端\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe I can find a diplomatic solution to this mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.85,1:36:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.92,1:36:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经放弃再和你争论了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given up trying to argue with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.09,1:36:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可爱的小朋友，如果他们需要我们的帮助…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My obtuse little friend, if they had needed our help…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.43,1:36:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会告诉我们的，不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}they would have asked for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.43,1:36:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来对于人类的行为方式，你还有很多要学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You obviously have a great deal to learn about human behavior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.46,1:36:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一个机器人来说，你考虑得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a mechanic, you seem to do an excessive amount of thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.73,1:36:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的程序设计就是让我来理解人类的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am programmed to understand humans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.90,1:37:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你问我这是什么意思？」 哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What does that mean?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.91,1:37:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是这里我说了算！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means I am in charge here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.74,1:37:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要上哪儿去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.48,1:37:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道那里有多危险 难道你一点都没有感到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what's out there. Have you no sense at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.35,1:37:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.25,1:37:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.79,1:37:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你要去哪儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where you're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.34,1:37:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.76,1:37:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕德梅！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.75,1:38:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我的天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.58,1:38:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我关掉吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut me down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.25,1:38:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器制造机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Machines making machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.35,1:38:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈！ 真是奇怪，哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How perverse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.76,1:39:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静，R2！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, R2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.29,1:39:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点摔下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.89,1:39:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你看的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get your chance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.86,1:39:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！ 我被扔掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scrap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.77,1:39:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这像是一场恶梦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a nightmare!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.94,1:39:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我要回家！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.44,1:39:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我到底干了什么落到这个下场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I do to deserve this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.28,1:40:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道可怜的小R2现在怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what happened to poor little R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.59,1:40:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是给自己惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always getting himself into trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.36,1:40:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.37,1:40:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.64,1:40:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so confused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.49,1:42:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，又来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.66,1:42:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下欧比旺会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan's gonna kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.77,1:42:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动，绝地武士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move, Jedi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.30,1:42:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.82,1:42:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.43,1:43:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不害怕去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.27,1:43:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天我都像死一样的受着折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been dying a little bit each day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.33,1:43:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你重回到我的生活中以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you came back into my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.67,1:43:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.71,1:43:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.55,1:43:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.99,1:43:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原以为我们已经决定不再去爱对方了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had decided not to fall in love…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.00,1:43:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在以后的人生中，我们都必须不断的欺骗自己…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we would be forced to live a lie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.87,1:43:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我们的生命实际已经结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that it would destroy our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.54,1:43:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想现在无论如何我们的生命都将结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think our lives are about to be destroyed anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.18,1:43:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.01,1:43:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,深深的－爱着你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}deeply love you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.65,1:43:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们死之前，我要让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and before we die, I want you to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.38,1:44:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在开始怀疑你是否收到了我的讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was beginning to wonder if you'd got my message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.11,1:45:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全按你所说的把讯息转送了，师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I retransmitted it just as you had requested, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.55,1:45:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们决定来救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we decided to come and rescue you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.39,1:45:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.27,1:45:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle down. Settle down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.31,1:45:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,处决开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the executions begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.88,1:46:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不太妙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a bad feeling about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.41,1:46:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放松，集中注意力 - 帕德梅怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just relax. Concentrate. - What about Padmé?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.98,1:46:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好像已经爬到什么东西的顶上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems to be on top of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.11,1:47:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让她这么做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.94,1:47:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪决她… 或类似方式！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her… or something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.69,1:49:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.22,1:49:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会变成这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't how it's supposed to be!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.29,1:49:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,强格！杀了她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jango! Finish her off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.62,1:49:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心，总督，请保持耐心，我会让她死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, Viceroy, patience. She will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.69,1:50:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,温杜大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Windu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.26,1:50:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你也来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How pleasant of you to join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.69,1:50:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This party's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.31,1:50:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很勇敢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.68,1:50:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有点愚蠢，我的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}but foolish, my old Jedi friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.15,1:50:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人数少的可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're impossibly outnumbered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.12,1:50:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.55,1:50:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.72,1:51:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腿动不了了，我需要维修\N{\fnArial\fs30}My legs aren't moving. I must need maintenance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.07,1:52:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音那么吵？打仗了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this noise? A battle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.64,1:52:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，你们完全搞错了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been some terrible mistake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.94,1:52:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个文雅的礼仪机器人，我不是战斗机器人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm programmed for etiquette, not destruction!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.20,1:53:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧，绝地狗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die, Jedi dogs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.16,1:53:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！我刚才说什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! What did I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.01,1:53:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，亲爱的，我真是太抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. I'm terribly sorry about all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.98,1:53:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅，我被你压住了，让我起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. I'm trapped. I can't get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.83,1:54:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你说的外交解决吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this a diplomatic solution?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.85,1:54:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我称之为激烈谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I call it aggressive negotiations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.01,1:54:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊哦 - 收到，收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-oh. - Roger, roger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.13,1:54:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，你在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.60,1:54:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.07,1:54:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停下来！你拉住我的什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop that! You're going to strain something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.81,1:54:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My neck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.88,1:54:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要把我带到哪里去？我的头被你拽的好难受！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where are you taking me? This is such a drag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.92,1:55:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我已经到了自己的身体边上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm quite beside myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.66,1:55:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，请小心一点！你要烧焦我的电路板了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, please be careful! You're singeing my circuits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.33,1:55:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，但是我的头的位置有没有对正？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but is my head on straight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.63,1:55:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,温杜大师…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Windu…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.36,1:55:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的战斗很精彩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have fought gallantly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.76,1:55:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得载入绝地武士的史册之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}worthy of recognition in the archives of theJedi order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.77,1:55:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.04,1:56:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.54,1:56:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrender…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.64,1:56:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会放你们一条生路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your lives will be spared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.21,1:56:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会成为你们用来交换的人质，杜库！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not be hostages to be bartered, Dooku!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.45,1:56:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.95,1:56:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾，老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.70,1:56:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.15,1:56:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,围绕着悻存者的四周射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around the survivors a perimeter create.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.64,1:57:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我做了一个十分怪异的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had the most peculiar dream!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.29,1:57:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让杜库逃跑了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Dooku escapes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.39,1:57:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将会去召集更多反叛的星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}rally more systems to his cause he will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.63,1:58:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.00,1:58:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝能源炉上射击！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim right above the fuel cells!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.31,1:58:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好，我年轻的徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good call, my young Padawan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.83,1:58:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士聚集了一支庞大的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}TheJedi have amassed a huge army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.26,1:58:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这应该是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't seem possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.43,1:58:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士怎么可能那么快带来一支如此大的军队？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could theJedi come up with an army so quickly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.24,1:58:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须把所有的机器人士兵投入战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must send all available droids into battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.77,1:58:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的人数太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are too many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.64,1:58:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的对外通讯被切断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our communications have been jammed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.62,1:59:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶，在那个集合点降落！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot, land in that assembly area!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.62,1:59:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.03,1:59:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.40,1:59:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召集了五支特别突击队听候您的调遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have five special commando units awaiting your orders, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.04,1:59:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我带到前方的指挥部\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the forward command center take me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.66,1:59:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击那些联邦的星舰！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack those Federation starships, quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.38,2:00:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达大师，各路前锋部队都在向前突进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Yoda, all forward positions are advancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.28,2:00:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.78,2:00:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.61,2:00:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况看上去一点都不好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not looking good at all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.98,2:00:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须乘上星舰返回外太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must get the starships back into space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.29,2:00:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须下达命令撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to order a retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.33,2:00:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的主人绝不会允许共和国…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master will never allow the Republic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.80,2:00:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这种背信的行为而取得胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get away with this treachery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.27,2:00:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经让我的战士躲藏到了地下墓穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending my warriors to hide in the catacombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.60,2:00:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能让绝地武士发现我们开发的终极武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}TheJedi must not find our designs for the ultimate weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.07,2:01:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们发觉了我们正打算建造的东西，我们就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they find out what we are planning to build, we're doomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.62,2:01:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会将设计图带到克罗斯肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take the designs with me to Coruscant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.99,2:01:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我的主人保管它将会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be much safer there with my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.24,2:02:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中所有火力攻击最近的那艘星舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate all your fire on the nearest starship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.15,2:02:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.08,2:02:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有火力集中到5-1-5区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move all quadrants to sector 515.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.69,2:03:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look over there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.63,2:03:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是杜库！把他打下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dooku! Shoot him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.14,2:03:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的导弹用完了，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of rockets, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.14,2:03:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟着他！ - 我们需要支援！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow him! - We're gonna need some help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.11,2:03:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了！我和安纳金能够应付！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't time! Anakin and I can handle this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.46,2:03:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕德梅！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.63,2:03:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把飞船停下来！ - 安纳金！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put the ship down! - Anakin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.34,2:03:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让你的个人感情左右你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let your personal feelings get in the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.34,2:03:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上那摩托艇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow that speeder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.18,2:03:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把船停下！ - 我一个人不能应付杜库！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lower the ship! - I can't take Dooku alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.65,2:03:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.40,2:03:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能够抓住他，我们就能马上结束战争！\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we catch him, we can end this war right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.25,2:04:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们需要完成任务！ - 我不在乎任务！ 把船停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have a job to do! - I don't care! Put the ship down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.36,2:04:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样做会被驱逐出绝地武士团！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be expelled from theJedi order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.76,2:04:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能丢下她！ - 恢复理智吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't leave her! - Come to your senses!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.10,2:04:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一下如果帕德梅处在你的位置之下她会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think Padmé would do were she in your position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.37,2:04:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会尽她的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would do her duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.38,2:04:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人军队已经全线撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}The droid army is in full retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.55,2:04:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的好，指挥官，给我调一艘飞船来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Commander. Bring me a ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.65,2:05:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会为你今天所杀的绝地武士付出代价，杜库\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna pay for all the Jedi that you killed today, Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.88,2:05:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起来对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take him together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.68,2:05:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在就来解决他！ - 不，安纳金！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm taking him now! - No, Anakin! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.83,2:05:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你所见到的那样，我的绝地武士力量远胜于你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you see, my Jedi powers are far beyond yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.43,2:05:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁现在… 快回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… back down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.21,2:05:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.35,2:05:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯诺比大师，你真是让我失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Kenobi, you disappoint me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.69,2:05:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达大师是如此的欣赏你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoda holds you in such high esteem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.13,2:05:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定应该能做的更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you can do better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.74,2:06:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.05,2:06:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好还是赶快回前方指挥部\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better get back to the forward command center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.42,2:06:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.12,2:06:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,召集所有你所能召集的士兵，我们必须赶到那里的机库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather what troops you can. We've got to get to that hangar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.75,2:06:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一艘运输机，快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a transport. Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.82,2:06:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.02,2:06:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇气可嘉，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave of you, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.15,2:06:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我以为你刚才应该已经吸取教训了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I would have thought you had learned your lesson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.49,2:06:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是个不吸取教训的人 - 安纳金！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am a slow learner. - Anakin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.55,2:07:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.42,2:07:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜库伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.59,2:07:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是你最后一次的阻碍我的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have interfered with our affairs for the last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.26,2:08:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你变得更强大了，杜库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerful you have become, Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.69,2:08:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你身上感到了黑暗的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dark side I sense in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.90,2:08:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的力量已经超越了任何绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've become more powerful than anyJedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.80,2:08:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至包括你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.82,2:09:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有许多要学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much to learn you still have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.99,2:09:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显我们之间战斗的胜负不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is obvious that this contest cannot be decided…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.29,2:09:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,由对原力知识的多少来决定的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}by our knowledge of the Force…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.60,2:09:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是由我们剑术的高下来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by our skills with a lightsaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.44,2:09:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的剑术不赖，我的老徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fought well you have, my old Padawan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:57.31,2:09:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.42,2:11:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳金！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anakin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.27,2:12:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,原力属于我们，西迪斯大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force is with us, Master Sidious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.83,2:12:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来，泰伦斯阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Lord Tyranus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:39.67,2:12:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have done well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.11,2:12:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有好消息带给您，阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have good news for you, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:45.98,2:12:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 战争已经开始了 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The war has begun. - Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.62,2:12:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都已照计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is going as planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.30,2:13:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信杜库伯爵所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe what Count Dooku said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:04.27,2:13:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于西迪斯控制了参议院的事情吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}about Sidious controlling the senate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.80,2:13:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好像不太可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't feel right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.14,2:13:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜库已经加入了黑暗的一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joined the dark side Dooku has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:13.41,2:13:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谎言，欺骗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lies, deceit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.24,2:13:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,并制造猜疑已经成为了他所使用的伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}creating mistrust are his ways now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.15,2:13:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管如此…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:20.68,2:13:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得还是应该严密的监视参议院的动向\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel we should keep a closer eye on the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:23.82,2:13:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.99,2:13:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的徒弟在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your apprentice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.96,2:13:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到纳布星去了，护送阿米达拉参议院回国\N{\fnArial\fs30}On his way to Naboo, escorting Senator Amidala home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.66,2:13:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不承认如果没有克隆人军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to admit that without the clones, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.90,2:13:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能取得胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would not have been a victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.40,2:13:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.33,2:13:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说胜利吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory, you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.84,2:13:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺大师，这不是胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Obi-Wan, not victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.08,2:13:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗势力的阴影已经笼罩了过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shroud of the dark side has fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.65,2:13:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,克隆人战争已经开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begun the Clone War has.{\r}
